{"3548270": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Next of Kin: Fidelity", "steam_appid": 3548270, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3950690], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you remember your worst nightmare? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Next of Kin: Fidelity, you follow Bjorn, a man haunted by a past that refuses to let go. A single event from his childhood still clings to him like a shadow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, he wakes up drenched in sweat, trapped in the same nightmare over and over again. But what is it that's haunting him – and how, or who, can set him free? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a player, you’re encouraged to explore every corner of the world. The more you interact with your surroundings, the more pieces of the story you'll uncover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next of Kin: Fidelity is a deeply emotional journey lasting 2–4 hours, featuring pixel art, atmospheric music, and a strong focus on storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bittersweet story with a mix of comedy and mature subjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features several endings depending on your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues, solve puzzles, and uncover the truth about Bjorn's past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack that enhances the story beats   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be a short but sweet experience </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you remember your worst nightmare? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Next of Kin: Fidelity, you follow Bjorn, a man haunted by a past that refuses to let go. A single event from his childhood still clings to him like a shadow. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night, he wakes up drenched in sweat, trapped in the same nightmare over and over again. But what is it that's haunting him – and how, or who, can set him free? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a player, you’re encouraged to explore every corner of the world. The more you interact with your surroundings, the more pieces of the story you'll uncover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Next of Kin: Fidelity is a deeply emotional journey lasting 2–4 hours, featuring pixel art, atmospheric music, and a strong focus on storytelling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bittersweet story with a mix of comedy and mature subjects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features several endings depending on your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find clues, solve puzzles, and uncover the truth about Bjorn's past</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An original soundtrack that enhances the story beats   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed to be a short but sweet experience </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Step into the shoes of Bjorn, a man with a troubled past. One day, he meets a woman who resembles one of Bjorn's childhood friends who disappeared, and also shares the same name - Leyla. Is she his long-lost friend or someone else? ", "supported_languages": "English, Swedish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548270/header.jpg?t=1760080879", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548270/decd6bdd7c4256af2629154257e799dd8113a7e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760080879", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3548270/decd6bdd7c4256af2629154257e799dd8113a7e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760080879", "website": "https://www.spelkvall.se", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li